/*
 * query — what an editor asks about a position of the source.
 *
 * The queries of a language server, answered from the semantic index of a
 * compilation (cf. `semantic::index`) and its symbol tree: the hover of a
 * token, the declaration and the references of the entity it names, the
 * outline of a file, and the completions at a position. A position is a line
 * and a column counted from 1 in bytes, as the tokens count them;
 * `QueryExporting` converts from and to the positions of the protocol.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::query
 * @File: ymirc/query.yr
 * @Author(s):
